OL,3,GNEWSAPolice examining video of
OL,4,Aanti-migrant activist slashing boat
OL,5,Awith knife
OL,6,
OL,7,FPolice are looking into a video
OL,8,Fappearing to show the anti-migrant
OL,9,Factivist known as Danny Tommo slashing
OL,10,Fat an inflatable boat with a knife in
OL,11,Fthe English Channel.
OL,13,FThe boat had been carrying about 50
OL,14,Fmigrants who had launched from a beach
OL,15,Fin Normandy. They were picked up by two
OL,16,FRNLI lifeboats once they had reached
OL,17,Fthe UK search and rescue area and were
OL,18,Ftaken to Dover for processing.
OL,23,APub: 23-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB S Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
FL,336,330,200,160,0,100
