OL,3,GNEWSAPolice examining video of
OL,4,Aanti-migrant activist slashing boat
OL,5,Awith knife
OL,6,
OL,7,FDaniel Thomas, known to his supporters
OL,8,Fas Danny Tommo, had been filming the
OL,9,Ftransfer from a yellow speedboat while
OL,10,Fgiving commentary to a live stream
OL,11,Faudience of more than 15,000 people.
OL,13,FThe video then shows him sailing up to
OL,14,Fthe boat, taking out a small knife and
OL,15,Fstart slashing at the side of the
OL,16,Fmigrant boat.
